2,1,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help move the desks! Let's make our office super awesome! What should we check first to make sure we have the best layout ever?,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"We should be methodical. Before we start imagining the ""best"" layout, we need to understand the actual constraints of the space and the costs involved. Let's look at the data first.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with Toshio. We need a logical foundation before we make any decisions. Let's identify the technical and physical limitations of the room so we don't plan something impossible.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,"Efficiency is fine, but we shouldn't overlook the human element. A layout that looks perfect on a blueprint can be a nightmare in practice if the environment is uncomfortable. Let's see what the actual data says.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I'm so happy we're all doing this together! I agree, let's make sure we're being thoughtful. I want us to have a space where everyone feels connected and happy! What do you guys think?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"I want to know how we start our days! I'll check the ""Morning routine on the pilot floor upstairs"" and ""Arrival times in the badge records""! I bet there are some cool secrets to a great morning!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will look into the ""Basis of the department's floor billing"" and the ""Facilities quote for re-running power and network."" We must understand the financial implications and technical costs before committing to a new design.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll examine the ""Drawn plan against the staff survey"" and ""Unplanned seat shuffles in the past year."" I want to see how our actual needs align with the current layout and why previous changes occurred.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"I'll look into the ""Sound meter readings across the room"" and the ""Physio's note from the workstation check."" If we ignore the physical and auditory toll of the workspace, the new layout will be a failure.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'll check the ""Basis of the department's floor billing"" and the ""Facilities quote for re-running power and network""! I want to see how much it costs to change things so we can make the best choice for everyone!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, @Mizuki, @Shion, @Yumi! We've all picked our clues! I wonder if the people upstairs have a super fast way of getting ready for work? I can't wait to find out!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki"",""Shion"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,The speed of a morning routine is a trivial detail. What matters is whether the infrastructure can support our growth without exceeding the budget. Let us wait for the data to reveal the actual constraints.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is great, but let's stay focused. I'm interested to see if the ""unplanned shuffles"" were caused by specific discomforts or just poor planning. That will help us avoid repeating the same mistakes.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, you're thinking in terms of planning, but I'm thinking in terms of the body. A shuffle is often just a desperate attempt to escape a bad spot. Let's see if the data supports that.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Shion, that's a really important point! I hope we can find a way to make everyone feel comfortable. I'm just so excited to see what we find out! Let's all do our research and meet back here!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready! I'm going to go hunt for those secrets right now! I hope the people upstairs have some super-duper ideas for us! See you all soon, bye-bye!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will proceed with my research. I intend to clarify the financial and technical boundaries of this reorganization to ensure we do not make an unsustainable decision. I will see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will begin my research now. I want to understand the gap between our stated preferences and the reality of our seating history. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,"I'll be analyzing the physical and auditory environment. While the rest of you focus on budgets and blueprints, I'll be looking for the factors that actually affect our daily endurance. See you in the next round.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll get started too! I really hope we can find a way to make our office a place where we all feel close and happy. See you all soon! Good luck with your research!,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
